# Keep the repository LF-only.
#
# GitHub Actions executes the `run:` blocks of workflow YAML with bash on the
# runner. A stray carriage return becomes part of the command and fails with
# "$'\r': command not found". This machine has core.autocrlf=true, so pin LF
# explicitly rather than relying on normalisation at commit time.
* text=auto eol=lf
